    "Four corpora (core-v1 inline fixture, zod-v1, click-v1, pyright-v1 checkouts), 2-3 cases per split; small public task sets, not general accuracy or agent-success estimates.",
    "The harness (scripts/bench/runner.ts) has no scopedAsk case kind; it only drives ask, callersDetailed and findTextDetailed. Before/after Recall@5 and MRR@5 in this record are therefore identical by construction and cannot detect any scopedAsk merge-rule change, comparable-score or round-robin. Two of the four corpora (zod-v1: root package.json workspaces; pyright-v1: root pnpm-workspace.yaml packages) do contain root workspace globs that the new detectScopes glob discovery would now surface as additional scopes, but nothing in this gate queries scopedAsk against them.",
    "zod-v1 and click-v1 checkouts were created fresh for this task under the session scratchpad via git clone --filter=blob:none --no-checkout followed by checkout to the manifest revision; they are disposable and not retained as long-lived fixtures.",
    "callers-kind cases report null Recall@5/MRR@5 (they use set-based callerPrecision/callerRecall instead); those fields are omitted from the recall/MRR comparison above."
  ],
